+    * one of ``stranded``: the base moved since its branch was cut, so its own change does
+      not merge onto ``<base_remote>/<base>``, and ``name`` was built on a newer base than
+      the line, so it carries what the partner clashes with. The partner's branch is to be
+      rebuilt on the new base; for this, ``name`` is not blamed, nor told to change.
+    * one of ``own``: ``name``'s own change conflicts with the partner's. A prerequisite
