+      ``Conflicts with`` is proposed — the edge is there already. Any other: the
+      ``Conflicts with`` proposal a same-wave hold gets (``_CONFLICT_STEP``, #674). No brief
+      is written."""
+    stranded, own = across
+    d = cfg.find_bundle(name.removeprefix("issue_"))
+    bp = d / "brief.md"
